  "releaseNotes": "# Bug Fixes\n\n      - Fixed an issue where the dialog background size did not match during auto-scaling.\n      - Fixed an issue where the minimum and maximum widths of Columns were not being applied.\n      - Fixed an issue where Links in ModuleField could not be retrieved.\n      - Fixed an issue where Submit failed with data structures that mutually referenced each other by Id.\n      - Fixed an issue where an exception occurred in ButtonField when an invalid character was entered as the background color in FieldLayoutDesign.",
